        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "Evidence And Limits",
        "body": "The source is strongest as conceptual and practice-based analysis. Its evidence includes technical definitions, procedural descriptions, cited aesthetic theory, event formats, and first-person accounts from Revision 2016 and 2018. It does not provide quantitative audience data or comparative studies, so broad claims about digital-art performance should be read as argued interpretation rather than measured generalization.",
